            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Partial review.  Overall, this patch seems to be breaking the mold a bit.  While I'm all for new design patterns, i'm against adding them as part of a new feature (especially one this simple in practice.)\n\nIf you want to check in Controls, do it the normal way we write code\n\nIf you want to make new things that make our mapping of dbus->redfish easier, lets prove that they work holistically by moving some existing feature forward, and showing that it's less code or less complex."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
