                        "username": "akurdunkar"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi Ed, Sorry I haven't been able to address the review comments on this patch as I was caught up in some other things. I will address the comments at the earliest."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/control.hpp",
                    "line": 54,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Please just implement these the \"normal\" way using methods.  These kinds of property mapping tables have been pitched before and rejected because they bloat code size.  If we're going to do something like this, lets do it holistically, and not as part of a new feature.  FWIW, we do something similar to this in sensors.hpp, and it's been a mess to maintain."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/control.hpp",
